</td><td align="center">35.0</td><td></td><td></td></tr><tr><td align="left">Male</td><td></td><td align="center">19.57 (2.34)</td><td align="center">19.6</td><td align="center">17.06 (2.23)</td><td align="center">17.0</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p>Results shown are after removing erroneous genotypes and removing founders that have all genotype information missing for Whites only.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap><table-wrap position="float" id="T2"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p>Significant results (<italic>q</italic>-value &#x0003c; 0.05) for genome-wide association analysis for recombination rates using SNPs.</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups"><thead><tr><td align="center">Chr</td><td align="center">Position (cM) (Marker)</td><td align="center">Unadjusted <italic>p</italic>-value</td><td align="center"><italic>q</italic>-value</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td align="center">1q</td><td align="left">129.761 tsc0831812</td><td align="center">3.99 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-5</sup></td><td align="center">0.032874</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="left">173.005 tsc1229896</td><td align="center">3.64 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-6</sup></td><td align="center">0.005141</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="left">176.25<sup>a </sup>tsc1687896</td><td align="center">3.74 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-5</sup></td><td align="center">0.032874</td></tr><tr><td align="center">2q</td><td align="left">136.452<sup>a </sup>tsc0333128</td><td align="center">1.01 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-5</sup></td><td align="center">0.012482</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="left">167.814 tsc0045403</td><td align="center">2.00 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-8</sup></td><td align="center">0.000198</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="left">167.817 tsc1108827</td><td align="center">1.21 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-6</sup></td><td align="center">0.001994</td></tr><tr><td align="center">3q</td><td align="left">70.968 tsc0753329</td><td align="center">4.95 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-5</sup></td><td align="center">0.037662</td></tr><tr><td align="center">4q</td><td align="left">94.916 tsc0056600</td><td align="center">8.00 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-8</sup></td><td align="center">0.000264</td></tr><tr><td align="center">8q</td><td align="left">103.504 tsc1305199</td><td align="center">6.00 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-8</sup></td><td align="center">0.000264</td></tr><tr><td align="center">10q</td><td align="left">45.654 tsc0615240</td><td align="center">2.60 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-7</sup></td><td align="center">0.000514</td></tr><tr><td></td><td align="left">74.381 tsc0046577</td><td align="center">1.45 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-5</sup></td><td align="center">0.015691</td></tr><tr><td align="center">13q</td><td align="left">50.514 tsc0616973</td><td align="center">2.40 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-7</sup></td><td align="center">0.000514</td></tr><tr><td align="center">14q</td><td align="left">85.42<sup>a </sup>tsc1112831</td><td align="center">1.59 &#x000d7; 10<sup>-5</sup></td><td align="center">0.015691</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><p>No significant results are found with microsatellites using the pFDR 0.05 cutoff</p><p><sup>a</sup>indicates that the marker identified was from the markers that had the same map position</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></sec></back></article>